1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:29,061
Think about standing in front of a mirror every morning. You see your face, your posture, your hands—yet everything keeping you alive stays completely hidden. Now imagine stepping up to that mirror, and looking straight inside your own living body—watching your heart beat, your lungs breathe, and 27 precision bones move in real time inside your bare hands! Welcome to Soma XR! One click, zero clutter—and your own body becomes a living 3D anatomy studio!

2
00:00:29,541 --> 00:00:57,374
Let's jump straight into Meta Quest Mixed Reality! Leave the controllers on the desk—you will never need them. Everything works right from a chair inside a comfortable two-foot reach. 26 hand joints lock 27 articulated bones directly onto your bare hands in real time! Watch this—poke the floating 3D console with your fingertip, tap Tabletop to bring a compact hologram right over your lap, and sweep your index finger like a glowing 3D X-Ray lens!

3
00:00:57,854 --> 00:01:17,455
And check this out—still seated in Mixed Reality, just hold your palm flat and tilt your wrist to slice 6DoF CT cross-sections at any angle! Every single organ inside is alive: a 72 BPM heart, breathing lungs, and a jaw and TMJ that articulate in real time with every word I speak!

4
00:01:17,935 --> 00:01:32,502
Want to explore every layer of the body? Glide smoothly from the cerebral cortex all the way down to 26-bone feet, or switch into Solid studio shading and pull living organs, skeleton, and striated muscle apart in three dimensions!

5
00:01:32,982 --> 00:02:08,590
Now here is what makes Soma XR truly game-changing for communities everywhere. Medical knowledge shouldn't be locked in one language—so listen right now as our 3D callouts and voice coach switch across English, Yorùbá, and Hausa: [English] Heart and Great Vessels. [Yorùbá] Ọkàn àti àwọn iṣan ẹ̀jẹ̀ ńlá. [Hausa] Zuciya da manyan jijiyoyi.

6
00:02:09,070 --> 00:02:24,460
Only have two minutes between classes or on a commute? Jump straight into a 60-second Fracture Scan or Quiz! Lock your X-Ray lens onto this midshaft clavicle fracture for an instant clinical read—pause or exit with a single tap, and pick right back up anytime!

7
00:02:24,940 --> 00:02:37,671
100% hands-first. Engineered for seated comfort. Speaking your community's language on Meta Quest Mixed Reality and any browser. This is Soma XR! Step in front of the mirror, and see what you're made of! Thank you!
